strating how long it takes to build an app"},{"title":"How to build a mobile app (step by step)","slug":"how-to-build-a-mobile-app","category":"Guide","excerpt":"How to build a mobile app, step by step, without the hype. Validate the idea, scope an MVP, pick an approach, design, build, test, launch, and iterate — here's the path and what each step actually takes.","readMin":9,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/how-to-build-a-mobile-app.webp","imageAlt":"A developer building a mobile app with a phone and code on screen, illustrating how to build a mobile app"},{"title":"How much does mobile app development cost? (2026)","slug":"mobile-app-development-cost","category":"Guide","excerpt":"How much does mobile app development cost in 2026? Honest ranges for a simple, mid-complexity, and complex app — plus the seven things that actually drive the price, and how to ship the same quality for less.","readMin":7,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/mobile-app-development-cost.webp","imageAlt":"Hands reviewing mobile app wireframe sketches with a calculator, illustrating mobile app development cost"},{"title":"React Native vs Flutter: which should you choose?","slug":"react-native-vs-flutter","category":"Guide","excerpt":"React Native vs Flutter, decided honestly. Both ship excellent cross-platform apps — React Native wins on JS/React talent and ecosystem reuse, Flutter wins on consistent UI and raw rendering performance. Here's how to pick for your team and your app.","readMin":7,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/react-native-vs-flutter.webp","imageAlt":"React Native and Flutter logos side by side, comparing the two cross-platform frameworks"},{"title":"What is mobile app development? (a practical guide)","slug":"what-is-mobile-app-development","category":"Guide","excerpt":"What is mobile app development, explained without the hype. The types of apps, the build process step by step, what drives cost and timeline, and how to pick a partner that ships something built to last.","readMin":7,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/what-is-mobile-app-development.webp","imageAlt":"A developer holding a smartphone with code on screen, illustrating what mobile app development is"}],"className":"mt-8"}]]}]
